__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.benchmarks/
.pytest_cache/
.claude/
.ruff_cache/
HANDOFF.md

# competition data: entry lists and results. A live competition is riders'
# personal data and a jury's work in progress - neither belongs in here.
#
# The exception is the fictional one, and only the four files it is *made* of:
# open it in the app and everything it then writes - races, comunicati, PDFs,
# the journal - is ignored like anybody else's, so the example can be run
# without ever dirtying the checkout. See competitions/example/README.md.
competitions/*
!competitions/example/
competitions/example/*
!competitions/example/README.md
!competitions/example/programme.yaml
!competitions/example/make_entries.py
!competitions/example/Iscritti_999999.xlsx

# copies of the last saved PDFs, served to the browser
static/

# the build: PyInstaller's work and dist trees, and the generated icon
/build/
/dist/
packaging/blueband.ico

# coverage and build metadata
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
